{
  "title": "长方体体积公式是怎么来的？",
  "formula": "V = a × b × h",
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "用小正方体来量体积",
      "narration": "体积就是物体占了多少空间。我们用边长1厘米的小正方体来堆，看看一个长方体能装多少个小正方体。先看一层：长4、宽3，一层铺满就是4×3=12个小正方体。",
      "scene": {
        "shapes": [
          {
            "id": "layer1",
            "type": "grid",
            "x": 110,
            "y": 80,
            "cols": 4,
            "rows": 3,
            "cellSize": 40,
            "highlightCells": [
              {"row":0,"col":0},{"row":0,"col":1},{"row":0,"col":2},{"row":0,"col":3},
              {"row":1,"col":0},{"row":1,"col":1},{"row":1,"col":2},{"row":1,"col":3},
              {"row":2,"col":0},{"row":2,"col":1},{"row":2,"col":2},{"row":2,"col":3}
            ],
            "showCount": true,
            "fill": "#818cf8",
            "stroke": "#d1d5db",
            "data": { "showLabels": true }
          }
        ],
        "labels": [
          { "text": "一层：4 × 3 = 12 个小正方体", "x": 200, "y": 245, "fontSize": 15, "fill": "#4f46e5" }
        ]
      },
      "hint": "一层的小正方体个数 = 长 × 宽"
    },
    {
      "title": "每层个数 = 长 × 宽",
      "narration": "观察这一层：沿长方向有4个，沿宽方向有3个，一层就是4×3=12个。也就是说，每层的小正方体个数 = 长 × 宽 = a × b。",
      "scene": {
        "shapes": [
          {
            "id": "layer2",
            "type": "grid",
            "x": 100,
            "y": 70,
            "cols": 4,
            "rows": 3,
            "cellSize": 40,
            "highlightCells": [
              {"row":0,"col":0},{"row":0,"col":1},{"row":0,"col":2},{"row":0,"col":3},
              {"row":1,"col":0},{"row":1,"col":1},{"row":1,"col":2},{"row":1,"col":3},
              {"row":2,"col":0},{"row":2,"col":1},{"row":2,"col":2},{"row":2,"col":3}
            ],
            "showCount": true,
            "fill": "#818cf8",
            "stroke": "#d1d5db",
            "data": { "showLabels": true }
          },
          {
            "id": "dim-a",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 180,
            "y": 55,
            "text": "长 a = 4",
            "fontSize": 13,
            "textFill": "#4f46e5",
            "data": { "anchor": "middle" }
          },
          {
            "id": "dim-b",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 75,
            "y": 130,
            "text": "宽 b = 3",
            "fontSize": 13,
            "textFill": "#4f46e5",
            "data": { "anchor": "middle" }
          }
        ],
        "labels": [
          { "text": "每层 = a × b = 4 × 3 = 12", "x": 200, "y": 250, "fontSize": 15, "fill": "#4f46e5" }
        ],
        "highlight": ["layer2"]
      },
      "hint": "一层有 长×宽 个小正方体"
    },
    {
      "title": "层数 = 高",
      "narration": "如果有2层，总体积就是2个12。层数就是高——高是2，就有2层。所以总数 = 每层个数 × 层数 = 12 × 2 = 24。",
      "scene": {
        "shapes": [
          {
            "id": "layer3a",
            "type": "grid",
            "x": 120,
            "y": 50,
            "cols": 4,
            "rows": 3,
            "cellSize": 32,
            "highlightCells": [
              {"row":0,"col":0},{"row":0,"col":1},{"row":0,"col":2},{"row":0,"col":3},
              {"row":1,"col":0},{"row":1,"col":1},{"row":1,"col":2},{"row":1,"col":3},
              {"row":2,"col":0},{"row":2,"col":1},{"row":2,"col":2},{"row":2,"col":3}
            ],
            "showCount": true,
            "fill": "#818cf8",
            "stroke": "#d1d5db"
          },
          {
            "id": "layer3b",
            "type": "grid",
            "x": 120,
            "y": 155,
            "cols": 4,
            "rows": 3,
            "cellSize": 32,
            "highlightCells": [
              {"row":0,"col":0},{"row":0,"col":1},{"row":0,"col":2},{"row":0,"col":3},
              {"row":1,"col":0},{"row":1,"col":1},{"row":1,"col":2},{"row":1,"col":3},
              {"row":2,"col":0},{"row":2,"col":1},{"row":2,"col":2},{"row":2,"col":3}
            ],
            "showCount": true,
            "fill": "#a5b4fc",
            "stroke": "#d1d5db"
          },
          {
            "id": "layer3-label-a",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 70,
            "y": 90,
            "text": "第1层",
            "fontSize": 12,
            "textFill": "#4f46e5",
            "data": { "anchor": "middle" }
          },
          {
            "id": "layer3-label-b",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 70,
            "y": 195,
            "text": "第2层",
            "fontSize": 12,
            "textFill": "#4f46e5",
            "data": { "anchor": "middle" }
          },
          {
            "id": "h-label",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 260,
            "y": 122,
            "text": "高 h = 2层",
            "fontSize": 13,
            "textFill": "#ef4444",
            "data": { "anchor": "start" }
          }
        ],
        "labels": [
          { "text": "总数 = 12 × 2 = 24", "x": 200, "y": 265, "fontSize": 15, "fill": "#4f46e5" }
        ],
        "highlight": ["layer3a", "layer3b"]
      },
      "hint": "层数 = 高 h，总数 = 每层 × 层数"
    },
    {
      "title": "得出公式",
      "narration": "每层个数 = 长 × 宽 = a × b，层数 = 高 = h，所以总数 = a × b × h。这就是长方体的体积公式：V = a × b × h！",
      "scene": {
        "shapes": [
          {
            "id": "formula-box",
            "type": "rect",
            "x": 70,
            "y": 70,
            "width": 260,
            "height": 120,
            "fill": "#eef2ff",
            "stroke": "#6366f1",
            "strokeWidth": 2,
            "radius": 8
          },
          {
            "id": "f-step1",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 200,
            "y": 100,
            "text": "每层个数 = a × b",
            "fontSize": 15,
            "textFill": "#374151",
            "data": { "anchor": "middle" }
          },
          {
            "id": "f-step2",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 200,
            "y": 130,
            "text": "层数 = h",
            "fontSize": 15,
            "textFill": "#374151",
            "data": { "anchor": "middle" }
          },
          {
            "id": "f-step3",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 200,
            "y": 165,
            "text": "体积 = 每层 × 层数",
            "fontSize": 15,
            "textFill": "#4f46e5",
            "data": { "anchor": "middle" }
          }
        ],
        "labels": [
          { "text": "长方体体积 = 长 × 宽 × 高", "x": 200, "y": 230, "fontSize": 14, "fill": "#374151" }
        ],
        "formula": "V = a × b × h"
      },
      "hint": "每层个数(a×b) × 层数(h) = 体积"
    }
  ]
}
